  and wallet logic (per-chain history parsing, token metadata sources, explorer links)
  follow Gem Wallet. Since Hwallet 1.3 the home header (centred wallet chip, scan and
  search) and the round Send / Receive buttons copy Gem's layout, with Gem's Material
  Symbols icons (send, QR code, QR scanner, search, chevron; Apache-2.0 by Google, as
